msgstr "**目标：** 通过 VR 或同构遥操作控制机器人。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:158
#: 516c61fd405d4f8a87b9e48bd25d09f0
msgid "VR Teleoperation"
msgstr "VR 遥操作"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:160
#: 4e1a186da8cf4c648e5b0923b7ef6507
msgid ""
"**Supported headsets:** Pico Enterprise (recommended; USB 网络共享, Enterprise "
"App), Pico consumer (different App), and Meta Quest. Backends: WebXR "
"(`./run.sh vr`) or XRoboToolkit (`./run.sh vr-xrt`)."
msgstr ""
"**支持的头显：** Pico 企业版（推荐；USB 网络共享、企业版 App）、Pico 消费版（不同 App）和 Meta "
"Quest。后端：WebXR（`./run.sh vr`）或 XRoboToolkit（`./run.sh vr-xrt`）。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:162
#: 878cf7e6f625475386867fad1faca410
msgid ""
"cd fa-py-libraries\n"
"./run.sh vr\n"
msgstr ""
"cd fa-py-libraries\n"
"./run.sh vr\n"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:167
#: 3142fd26859e4b01816f97e03e7653cf
msgid "Pico Enterprise vs consumer"
msgstr "Pico 企业版与消费版"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:170
#: abeed5a689b042f5bf6a7364c1d369dd
msgid ""
"Pico **Enterprise** and Pico **consumer** are different SKUs: Enterprise "
"supports USB 网络共享 and uses a **different App**. Do not install one App for "
"both."
msgstr ""
"Pico **企业版** 与 Pico **消费版** 是不同 SKU：企业版支持 USB 网络共享，并使用**不同的 App**。不要为两者安装同一个"
" App。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:173
#: 0a0d8f06809d44f099b97bacd28f94ed
msgid "Isomorphic Teleop (HT Panthera)"
msgstr "同构遥操作（HT Panthera）"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:175
#: 3a33eea521bf431baa909eebc289c565
msgid "Master–slave **isomorphic teleop** (同构遥操作). Two processes:"
msgstr "主从 **同构遥操作**。需要两个进程："

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:177
#: 7e952f0e2c00477bb493b7d38b895968
msgid ""
"ros2 launch drag_teleop_controller drag_teleop_controller.launch.py \\\n"
"  role:=master hardware:=mock_components\n"
"ros2 launch drag_teleop_controller drag_teleop_controller.launch.py \\\n"
"  role:=slave hardware:=mock_components\n"
msgstr ""
"ros2 launch drag_teleop_controller drag_teleop_controller.launch.py \\\n"
"  role:=master hardware:=mock_components\n"
"ros2 launch drag_teleop_controller drag_teleop_controller.launch.py \\\n"
"  role:=slave hardware:=mock_components\n"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:184
#: d932402e42104dd9b57a61311be16dc1
msgid ""
"**Primary sources:** VR pose publisher, "
"[drag_teleop_controller](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/drag_teleop_controller)"
msgstr ""
"**主要来源：** VR 位姿发布器、[drag_teleop_controller](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/drag_teleop_controller)"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:186
#: bc74b40191244004b1e8f2531b9575ee
msgid ""
"**Outcome:** Real-time control via VR headset or master–slave isomorphic "
"teleop."
msgstr "**预期结果：** 通过 VR 头显或主从同构遥操作进行实时控制。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:188
#: 99b859f653df4b9bb82ee290f5c61567
msgid "Day 6: Real Hardware"
msgstr "第 6 天：真实硬件"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:190
#: 38e6be55ec5d4ff5a8dfdb2f68897499
msgid "**Goal:** Deploy to physical robots."
msgstr "**目标：** 部署到实体机器人。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:192
#: bac60d99ca56427d80973a1ab804669d
msgid "Public Path (ARX Acone, HT Panthera)"
msgstr "公开路径（ARX Acone、HT Panthera）"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:194
#: 6d6ef3eea6d94e0a99c95387f7f6d0bb
msgid ""
"External users can deploy to **ARX Acone** and **HT Panthera** using only "
"public packages:"
msgstr "外部用户仅使用公开软件包即可部署到 **ARX Acone** 与 **HT Panthera**："

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:196
#: 04c892e8269f476b9ae2d782b293bba6
msgid "**ARX Acone (CAN bus):**"
msgstr "**ARX Acone（CAN 总线）：**"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:197
#: 77e50b3e4536486daa4f106c70048a34
msgid ""
"cd ~/open-deploy-ws\n"
"source install/setup.bash\n"
"\n"
"# Configure CAN interface\n"
"sudo ip link set can0 type can bitrate 1000000\n"
"sudo ip link set can0 up\n"
"\n"
"# Deploy to real hardware\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py robot:=arx_acone hardware:=real\n"
msgstr ""
"cd ~/open-deploy-ws\n"
"source install/setup.bash\n"
"\n"
"# Configure CAN interface\n"
"sudo ip link set can0 type can bitrate 1000000\n"
"sudo ip link set can0 up\n"
"\n"
"# Deploy to real hardware\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py robot:=arx_acone hardware:=real\n"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:209
#: 5c5d9554d5774741bb82f3f614ccaef4
msgid "**HT Panthera (Serial):**"
msgstr "**HT Panthera（串口）：**"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:210
#: 67d1406464414fee866f1ae8b6f366e5
msgid ""
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py robot:=ht_panthera "
"hardware:=real\n"
msgstr ""
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py robot:=ht_panthera "
"hardware:=real\n"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:214
#: b6b39d7b45574f9594ecfe922a58adaa
msgid "Internal Path (FA Robots)"
msgstr "内部路径（FA 机器人）"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:216
#: d2fc6e3d8613456586f27578b1b0beb9
msgid "Internal Access Required"
msgstr "需要内部访问权限"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:219
#: f282820cb6a245268b16c999cf4b1d9d
msgid ""
"FA robots (W2, W2R, S2, S2R, dual-arm CCS) require access to `fa-deploy-ws`."
" Contact your team lead for repository access and hardware allocation."
msgstr "FA 机器人（W2、W2R、S2、S2R、双臂 CCS）需要访问 `fa-deploy-ws`。请联系团队负责人申请仓库权限并分配硬件。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:223
#: e3ebe6e0bd32422ab9de959ad355b66b
msgid "Clone `fa-deploy-ws` and initialize for your robot (e.g., W2):"
msgstr "克隆 `fa-deploy-ws` 并为你的机器人初始化（例如 W2）："

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:224
#: 19ef81fddf2d46fc87846258f400c659
msgid ""
"git clone <internal-url>/fa-deploy-ws.git\n"
"cd fa-deploy-ws\n"
"./init_repo.sh --robot fiveages_w2\n"
msgstr ""
"git clone <internal-url>/fa-deploy-ws.git\n"
"cd fa-deploy-ws\n"
"./init_repo.sh --robot fiveages_w2\n"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:229
#: 092c85dfae2a40959d0dbcf19e450dec
msgid ""
"Configure `robot.local.yaml` with your robot's parameters (network settings,"
" domain ID, etc.)"
msgstr "在 `robot.local.yaml` 中配置机器人参数（网络设置、Domain ID 等）"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:230
#: 388a1934e05f4c96bbaeb3740e143a83
msgid "Run the quick start:"
msgstr "运行快速启动："

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:231
#: e6c5169bde3a4e0eab03fd1013da380e
msgid "./quick_start.sh\n"
msgstr "./quick_start.sh\n"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:235
#: ab3b0b329e9149509b1aab54dbda5fab
msgid ""
"**Safety:** Always start with `mock` mode, verify trajectories, then switch "
"to real hardware."
msgstr "**安全：** 始终先从 `mock` 模式开始，确认轨迹无误后再切换到真实硬件。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:237
#: 2c78b81ca5a349daa8a1ac49d9d3a1c8
msgid "Day 7+: Add a Robot"
msgstr "第 7 天及以后：添加机器人"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:239
#: e817512a8082423f9e80bbfb0a678454
msgid "**Goal:** Integrate a new robot into the ecosystem."
msgstr "**目标：** 将新机器人集成到生态系统中。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:242
#: bee4d77d57ea487f9cd0d2df6f010a1c
msgid "Create a description package with URDF/xacro"
msgstr "用 URDF/xacro 创建描述包"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:243
#: 2e3752174b794f0d982398425cbb77d6
msgid "Add ros2_control hardware interface YAML"
msgstr "添加 ros2_control 硬件接口 YAML"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:244
#: 8d4f4be52b7b4748b9b298e7e93e117d
msgid "Configure OCS2 controller parameters"
msgstr "配置 OCS2 控制器参数"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:245
#: b72d4a421f9a46d4ae24cac0c75e32ac
msgid "Test progression: mock → simulation → real hardware"
msgstr "测试进阶顺序：mock → 仿真 → 真实硬件"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:247
#: cdd115c8479a422e843a013f4c5d8eb1
msgid ""
"See the [Developer Guide](../5-developer/0-index.md) for detailed "
"instructions."
msgstr "详细说明请参阅[开发者指南](../5-developer/0-index.md)。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:249
#: 42a113965eff44679dbdc17d98f49f69
msgid "Optional: Synthetic data (Isaac)"
msgstr "可选：合成数据（Isaac）"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:251
#: a5a0eaf9666e467a86ca36715d95f1f1
msgid ""
"**Goal:** Understand the Isaac datagen path (not Gazebo): USD scene → "
"`ROS2RobotInterface` → composer `task_queue` → LeRobot dataset on disk."
msgstr ""
"**目标：** 弄清 Isaac 数据采集路径（不是 Gazebo）：USD 场景 → `ROS2RobotInterface` → composer "
"`task_queue` → 磁盘上的 LeRobot 数据集。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:253
#: a7584007a0b4468b94ec82881728aea8
msgid ""
"Follow [Synthetic Data](../6-synthetic_data/0-index.md). Documented "
"composer/lerobot branches are `feature/dex-grasp-generator` and "
"`feature/sim-grasp-datagen`. Stop at recording/export; skip training."
msgstr ""
"见 [合成数据](../6-synthetic_data/0-index.md)。文档对应的 composer/lerobot 分支是 "
"`feature/dex-grasp-generator` 与 `feature/sim-grasp-datagen`。停在录制/导出；跳过训练。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:255
#: 878a267cd79c411ebd7a4550611aa2c4
msgid "Tips for Success"
msgstr "实用建议"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:257
#: 7f1a67a6aa6f45e391155818dd8bd1ad
msgid ""
"**Don't skip mock mode** — Always verify behavior in mock before simulation "
"or real hardware"
msgstr "**不要跳过 mock 模式** — 在进入仿真或真实硬件之前，务必先在 mock 中验证行为"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:258
#: 39ca249623d246248a70a90accf70a79
msgid ""
"**Read the warnings** — The stack logs helpful messages about configuration "
"issues"
msgstr "**阅读警告信息** — 技术栈会记录有助于排查配置问题的日志"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:259
#: ac185ba6ff754dac965752edd3025176
msgid ""
"**Use lean branches** — `open-deploy-ws` offers `dobot-cr5` and `arx-acone` "
"branches for minimal builds"
msgstr "**使用精简分支** — `open-deploy-ws` 提供 `dobot-cr5` 与 `arx-acone` 分支，便于最小化编译"

#: ../../source/0-overview/2-learning_path.md:260
#: f14f985059e946139923fd182b117e69
msgid ""
"**Ask questions** — File issues on the relevant repository for bugs or "
"unclear documentation"
msgstr "**提出问题** — 遇到缺陷或文档不清时，请在相应仓库提交 issue"

